<tr><td><code>postgres.yaml</code></td><td>Postgres StatefulSet + Service + PVC + init SQL ConfigMap</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>redis.yaml</code></td><td>Redis Deployment + Service</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>kafka.yaml</code></td><td>Kafka Deployment + Service (4 ports)</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>user-service.yaml</code></td><td>User Service Deployment + Service</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>transaction-service.yaml</code></td><td>Transaction Service Deployment + Service</td></tr>
