<h2>7. Ansible</h2>

<p>Ansible runs after Terraform to configure the EC2 Nginx instance. It <strong>no longer</strong> deploys application manifests (that's handled by Helm in CI).</p>

<h3>What Ansible Does</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Installs required packages (curl, git, unzip)</li>
  <li>Installs AWS CLI v2</li>
  <li>Installs kubectl (latest stable)</li>
  <li>Installs Helm 3</li>
  <li>Configures kubeconfig for EKS</li>
  <li>Verifies cluster access</li>
  <li>Installs <strong>ingress-nginx</strong> controller via Helm</li>
  <li>Installs <strong>Datadog Operator</strong> via Helm</li>
</ol>

