</code></pre>

<h3>Deploying to Production</h3>
<pre><code>git checkout prod
git merge test
git push origin prod
# → GitHub Actions pauses, reviewer approval required
# → After approval: deploys to banking-prod namespace
</code></pre>

<h3>Destroying an Environment</h3>
<pre><code># Go to GitHub → Actions → Destroy → Run workflow
# Select environment: dev / test / prod
# Optionally check "Also destroy shared infrastructure"
</code></pre>

