<h2>12. Monitoring & Observability</h2>

<div class="card">
<h3>Datadog (Test & Prod only)</h3>
<p>Datadog Operator is installed via Ansible on the EC2 instance. In test and prod, the Helm values enable Datadog agents which provide:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Infrastructure metrics (CPU, memory, network)</li>
  <li>APM / Distributed tracing for Java and Python services</li>
  <li>Log collection from all pods</li>
  <li>Kubernetes cluster orchestrator explorer</li>
</div>

