<h2>13. Security Considerations</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Namespace isolation</strong>: Each environment runs in its own K8s namespace with separate secrets and configmaps</li>
  <li><strong>Image tagging</strong>: Production deploys use git SHA tags (not <code>latest</code>) for immutability</li>
  <li><strong>Hibernate DDL</strong>: Set to <code>none</code> in prod to prevent automatic schema changes</li>
  <li><strong>TLS</strong>: Production ingress uses TLS with a cert-manager or pre-provisioned secret</li>
  <li><strong>Secrets</strong>: Production DB credentials should be set via GitHub Environment secrets (not in values files)</li>
  <li><strong>Approval gates</strong>: Production deployments and infrastructure destruction both require explicit human approval</li>
</ul>

